# This directory contains all MASES database migrations, organized by domain.
# The .gitkeep file ensures the directory is tracked in version control.
# Actual migration files will be placed in subdirectories:
# - Platform/
# - Auth/
# - Tenancy/
# - Authorization/
# - File/
# - Shareholder/
# - Finance/
# - Hr/
# - Arna/
# - Ai/
#
# Migrations are loaded automatically by CoreServiceProvider.